<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Carolina Power said cut.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Carolina Power said cut.</headline>
<text>
<p>-- Oppenheimer &amp; Co downgraded Carolina Power &amp; Light Co to market perform from outperform, according to an Oppenheimer source.</p>
<p>-- shares fell 1/4 to 37-5/8.</p>
</text>
